Bill Dunlap wrote;

f<-function(data)
{
        i <- order(data$Plot,  - data$DBH)
        data$DBHL <- data$DBH
        data$DBHL[i] <- unlist(lapply(split(data$DBH[i], data$Plot[i]), 
cumsum)
                ) - data$DBH[i]
        data
}

E.g., with a data frame d:
> f(d)

