From ripley at stats.ox.ac.uk  Fri Sep 10 06:27:49 1999
From: ripley at stats.ox.ac.uk (Prof Brian D Ripley)
Date: Fri, 10 Sep 1999 07:27:49 +0100
Subject: Re: [S] arima.diag residuals and arima.filt
